              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BraveSage2370"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was looking for some comfort food in Brisbane's cold snap and this hit the spot. I used tomatoe paste with basil a good hit of garlic, two cubes of oxo for the broth, one and a half tablespoons of flour a quarter teaspoon of the cinnamon and plenty of herbs. Make sure the flour is well cooked before adding the broth. Highly recommended.",
