            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tanga"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We had some left over garlic mashed potatoes that I needed to use. We used ground turkey added some fresh steam peas and carrotts. I had never had cottage pie before but my husband had asked for it a few months ago so the left over mashed fit his request perfectly. I baked them in 4 individual 8oz ramekins. He ate 2 for dinner and had the other for lunch the next day.",
