              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "anitaboo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family loved it. I didn’t use the cinnamon or italian spice - I substituted Trader Joe’s 21 Season Salute , 1 tsp Worcestershire sauce and added 1/4 tsp chili flakes. Only because I didn’t want to give it an Italian flavor.",
