            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cat Dickens"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is pretty great. I made some preferential additions:\n- boiled potatoes with a couple cloves of crushed garlic\n- I didn’t add Italian seasoning (didn’t have any) and only did 1 tbsp of parsley flakes\n- cooked 3 diced cloves of garlic to meat mixture (along with 1 large carrot, 1 onion, and some sweet peas)\n- Added wort. Sauce, ketchup (instead of the purée), and a dash of soy sauce to the meat.\n- Added 3 tbsp of bisto to the broth\n- Added 1/3 block of cream cheese to mashed potatoes",
            "datePublished": "2018-10-14T04:16:54.090Z"
